{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/kr/reviews/id211431690"}, "name":{"label":"Solidhoon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-28T07:30:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.53.1"}, "id":{"label":"14482290645"}, "title":{"label":"Warning"}, "content":{"label":"I strongly recommend being extremely careful with this app and its payment process.\n\nI was unexpectedly charged $49.99, a payment that I did not knowingly authorize or intend to make. I had absolutely no intention of subscribing to a service at this price or agreeing to recurring payments.\n\nI contacted customer support immediately after discovering the charge and demanded cancellation and a full refund. I also clearly stated that I do NOT authorize any future subscriptions, renewals, or charges.\n\nUsers should carefully check every payment screen and subscription condition before providing any payment information.\n\nI never intended to subscribe for $49.99. I want the charge fully refunded, all subscriptions permanently cancelled, and absolutely NO further charges.\n\nI will update this review when the refund is actually completed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/kr/review?id=1459969523&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"앱"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
