{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/kr/reviews/id274562543"}, "name":{"label":"개동건"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-08T18:47:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.52.0"}, "id":{"label":"14404910346"}, "title":{"label":"Refund request"}, "content":{"label":"I approved the payment of 1 dollar, but an additional 15 dollars was paid, and I didn’t receive the promised sketch. I request a refund. I won‘t discriminate between means and methods.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/kr/review?id=1459969523&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"앱"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/kr/reviews/id830467055"}, "name":{"label":"Cherry7678"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-05T09:02:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.52.0"}, "id":{"label":"14391496700"}, "title":{"label":"Misleading Subscription Scam"}, "content":{"label":"This app is deceptive and misleading.\n\nI signed up on the website only to view my astrology results. I agreed to pay 1USD to unlock my report, but I never signed up for a Premium subscription. At no point was it clearly explained that this $1 payment would automatically enroll me in a recurring membership.\n\nWithout my explicit knowledge or consent, I was later charged $49for a Premium subscription that I never intended to purchase.\n\nThis is an unacceptable and misleading billing practice. Customers should never be automatically enrolled in a recurring subscription without clear and transparent disclosure.\n\nI have requested a full refund. If this issue is not resolved immediately, I will dispute the charge with my bank/payment provider and report these deceptive practices to the appropriate consumer protection authorities.\n\nI strongly advise everyone to stay away from this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/kr/review?id=1459969523&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"앱"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
